  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets. Slice onion into wedges.\n• Place broccoli and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 15-20 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478ef66926770e8cd23d3/step-c594b200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook fusilli in boiling water over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478ef66926770e8cd23d3/step-999d0010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies are done, heat a large frying pan over medium heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook garlic & herb seasoning and the plain flour until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in cooking cream, the stock powder, milk, mustard and reserved pasta water. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins.\n• Add cooked pasta, roasted veggies and baby spinach, stirring to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478ef66926770e8cd23d3/step-33d9e620.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high.\n• Transfer pasta to a baking dish. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese. Grill until golden, 5-10 mins.\n• Divide pasta bake between bowls. Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478ef66926770e8cd23d3/step-00559830.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
